      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no point in trying to rewrite anything. it’s more like... the light is just fading out. everything feels so heavy and useless. i look at the future and i don't see anything for someone like me. it feels like there’s just this quiet, inevitable end coming, and honestly, it feels more peaceful than trying to fight it.",
